From: Liuqin Linux Kit contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Keep Liuqin backlight off until the DRM panel is enabled

Keep the requested brightness but let the board request an initially
powered-off LED output. Pair this with the native display-clock module:
the built-in backlight blanks the LEDs before clock takeover, and DRM
enables them only after panel initialization. Userspace brightness
restoration must preserve bl_power. LCD bias settings are unchanged.
Use a device-node property because ABL rewrites the root compatible.

--- a/drivers/video/backlight/ktz8866.c
+++ b/drivers/video/backlight/ktz8866.c
@@ -176,6 +176,10 @@
 	props.type = BACKLIGHT_RAW;
 	props.max_brightness = MAX_BRIGHTNESS;
 	props.brightness = DEFAULT_BRIGHTNESS;
+	/* Keep the requested brightness, but let the panel enable the LEDs. */
+	if (of_property_read_bool(client->dev.of_node,
+				  "kinetic,backlight-initially-off"))
+		props.power = BACKLIGHT_POWER_OFF;
 	props.scale = BACKLIGHT_SCALE_LINEAR;
 
 	backlight_dev = devm_backlight_device_register(&client->dev, "ktz8866-backlight",
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8475-xiaomi-liuqin.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8475-xiaomi-liuqin.dts
@@ -714,6 +714,7 @@
 		enable-gpios = <&tlmm 6 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;
 
 		current-num-sinks = <5>;
+		kinetic,backlight-initially-off;
 		kinetic,current-ramp-delay-ms = <128>;
 		kinetic,led-enable-ramp-delay-ms = <1>;
 		kinetic,enable-lcd-bias;
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/leds/backlight/kinetic,ktz8866.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/leds/backlight/kinetic,ktz8866.yaml
@@ -51,6 +51,12 @@
       mapped to 512μs because ktz8866 can't ramp faster than it.
     enum: [0, 1, 2, 4, 8, 16, 32, 64, 128, 256, 512, 1024, 2048, 4096, 8192, 16384]
 
+  kinetic,backlight-initially-off:
+    description: |
+      Keep the LED output powered off after probe until the display panel
+      enables its backlight. This does not disable the LCD bias outputs.
+    type: boolean
+
   kinetic,enable-lcd-bias:
     description: Set if we want to output bias power supply for LCD.
     type: boolean
